1
00:00:00,316 --> 00:00:04,016
Wow, ha, so you guys are, like, buds now?

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,880
(Raj:)Oh, yeah. We hang out all the time.

3
00:00:06,055 --> 00:00:08,715
(Stuart:)He doesn't have a girlfriend,
I don't have a girlfriend.

4
00:00:08,891 --> 00:00:13,121
(Raj:)It's like we both had these holes in our lives,
but now we fill each other's holes.

5
00:00:20,069 --> 00:00:24,029
(Stuart:)That sounds a little funny
to an American ear.

6
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:27,640
- Which part?
- Just all of it.

7
00:00:29,078 --> 00:00:32,378
Okay, so, what...?
What do you guys got going on, tonight?

8
00:00:32,581 --> 00:00:35,641
(Stuart:)Raj is taking me
to the Sound of Music sing-along.

9
00:00:36,485 --> 00:00:39,945
(Howard:)Sound of Music sing-along?
That used to be our thing, but that's cool.

10
00:00:40,589 --> 00:00:44,359
(Raj:)Howard, it's still our thing. Come with us.
We'll get you a scalped ticket.

11
00:00:45,061 --> 00:00:47,151
(Howard:)So I'd be sitting by myself?

12
00:00:47,563 --> 00:00:50,263
(Raj:)We'll switch.
You'll come sit with me after intermission.

13
00:00:50,466 --> 00:00:53,766
(Howard:)So I'd be sitting by myself
during "Edelweiss"?

14
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:56,670
(Howard:)No, no, you guys go.

15
00:00:56,906 --> 00:00:58,306
(Howard:)Have fun.

16
00:00:58,507 --> 00:01:01,807
- Okay. Will I get to see you tomorrow?
- Absolutely. See you, Stuart.

